   "narration": "In 1989, Solidarity won the first partly free election in the Soviet bloc. Months later, on January first, 1990, Poland did something economists still argue about. It ripped the bandage off. {p} Price controls: gone. Subsidies to state factories: gone. The currency: let it float, let it fall. They called it shock therapy. {pp} The shock part was real.",
